"{\"url\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/project/prj_1J7NQMR9V1S04P0D\",\"title\":\"Project Serra da Mantiqueira — Isometric\",\"head\":[\"VALIDATED\",\"EW\",\"1,000Y+\",\"Project Serra da Mantiqueira\",\"InPlanet\",\"ISSUED\",\"389.42\",\"BUFFER POOL\",\"7.789\",\"CREDITING PERIOD\",\"30 May 2023 to 29 May 2028\",\"Summary\"],\"issued_header\":\"389.42\",\"buffer_header\":\"7.789\",\"crediting\":\"30 May 2023 to 29 May 2028\",\"verifier\":\"350Solutions\",\"code\":\"EN4R\",\"approval\":\"23 Dec 2024\",\"protocol_current\":\"Enhanced Weathering in Agriculture v1.0\",\"protocol_baseline\":null,\"cert_issued\":\"389.42\",\"cert_retired\":\"81.025\",\"cert_buffer\":\"7.789\",\"reversal\":\"The risk of reversal for this project has been assessed as very low. This means that 2% of certificates issued for this project are allocated to InPlanet's buffer pool.\\n\\nTo date, this project has contributed 7.789 certificates to the buffer pool which holds a total of 14.189 certificates.\\n\\nInPlanet has no reversals to date.\",\"showing\":[\"Showing 5 of 6\",\"Showing 2 of 2\"],\"tables\":[{\"heads\":[\"Submission date\",\"Title\",\"Download\"],\"rows\":[[\"18 Mar 2026\",\"Verification Report\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"18 Mar 2026\",\"GHG Statement Report\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"23 Dec 2024\",\"No Public Comment Period\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"23 Dec 2024\",\"PDD\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"23 Dec 2024\",\"GHG Statement\",\"PDF | ->\"]]},{\"heads\":[\"Issue date\",\"Issued\",\"Buffer pool\",\"Supplier allocation\"],\"rows\":[[\"18 Mar 2026\",\"153.89\",\"3.078\",\"150.812\"],[\"23 Dec 2024\",\"235.53\",\"4.711\",\"230.819\"]]}],\"links\":[{\"h\":\"/supplier/spl_1HW7TJTRT1S0QM20\",\"t\":\"InPlanet\"},{\"h\":\"https://350solutions.com\",\"t\":\"350Solutions\"},{\"h\":\"/protocol/enhanced-weathering-agriculture/1.0\",\"t\":\"Enhanced Weathering in Agriculture v1.0\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1HW7TJTRT1S0QM20/prj_1J7NQMR9V1S04P0D/pjd_1JYRAHEYK1S0A52W/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"Project Design Document | 23 Dec 2024\"},{\"h\":\"/ghg-entry/rmv_1KHKJDP401S0EP87?tab=calculation-view\",\"t\":\"See GHG entry →\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1HW7TJTRT1S0QM20/prj_1J7NQMR9V1S04P0D/pjd_1KM0S58V31S0B5MV/verification_report.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1HW7TJTRT1S0QM20/prj_1J7NQMR9V1S04P0D/pjd_1KM0S30J11S0ZB8Z/ghg_statement_report.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1HW7TJTRT1S0QM20/prj_1J7NQMR9V1S04P0D/pjd_1K3NJYVNB1S0HQVE/no_public_comment_period.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1HW7TJTRT1S0QM20/prj_1J7NQMR9V1S04P0D/pjd_1JYRAHEYK1S0A52W/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1HW7TJTRT1S0QM20/prj_1J7NQMR9V1S04P0D/pjd_1JH2PK4251S07MN6/ghg_statement.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"}],\"text\":\"VALIDATED\\nEW\\n1,000Y+\\nProject Serra da Mantiqueira\\nInPlanet\\nISSUED\\n389.42\\nBUFFER POOL\\n7.789\\nCREDITING PERIOD\\n30 May 2023 to 29 May 2028\\nSummary\\nRemoval method\\nCalculation overview\\nProject documentation\\nCertificates\\nReversal risk\\nSummary\\n\\nEnhanced Weathering project executed on ~1000 Ha of sugarcane plantation in Brazil. The purpose of the project is to remove carbon durably through the application of locally sourced basaltic rock powder, at an application rate of 10t/Ha, whilst restoring degraded soils. The maximum removal potential of the rock powder spread equates to approximately 2700t CO₂e. The project name reflects a symbol of cultural and ecological diversity in Brazil and means \\\"Raindrop\\\".\\n\\nPROJECT DETAILS\\nCurrent verifier\\n350Solutions\\n->\\nProject code\\nEN4R\\nApproval date\\n23 Dec 2024\\nCurrent protocol version\\nEnhanced Weathering in Agriculture v1.0\\n⌘ + scroll to zoom\\nProject Serra da Mantiqueira\\nHow carbon is being removed\\n\\nEnhanced Weathering (EW) accelerates the Earth's natural chemical weathering process to remove carbon dioxide from the atmosphere. In chemical weathering, carbon dioxide dissolved in rainwater reacts with minerals in rocks, partly dissolving them and producing stable bicarbonate ions. These bicarbonate ions are transported by rivers to the ocean, where they are safely stored for thousands of years. EW is typically carried out by spreading crushed reactive rocks or minerals on croplands.\\n\\nProject Design Document\\n23 Dec 2024\\nCalculation overview\\nCalculations demonstrating 153.89 tCO₂e removed from Project Serra da Mantiqueira on 03 Oct 2025\\nSee GHG entry →\\nNet CO₂e Removed\\n153.887 tCO₂e\\nSequestrations\\n163.347 tCO₂e\\n-\\nActivities\\n9.460 tCO₂e\\n⌘ + scroll to zoom\\nView full screen\\nProject documentation\\nSubmission date\\tTitle\\tDownload\\n18 Mar 2026\\tVerification Report\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n18 Mar 2026\\tGHG Statement Report\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n23 Dec 2024\\tNo Public Comment Period\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n23 Dec 2024\\tPDD\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n23 Dec 2024\\tGHG Statement\\tPDF\\n->\\nShowing 5 of 6\\nPrevious\\nNext\\nCertificates\\nIssued\\n389.42\\nRetired\\n81.025\\nBuffer pool\\n7.789\\nCrediting period\\n30 May 2023 to 29 May 2028\\nIssuances\\nRetirements\\nIssue date\\tIssued\\tBuffer pool\\tSupplier allocation\\n18 Mar 2026\\t153.89\\t3.078\\t150.812\\n23 Dec 2024\\t235.53\\t4.711\\t230.819\\nShowing 2 of 2\\nPrevious\\nNext\\nReversal risk\\n\\nThe risk of reversal for this project has been assessed as very low. This means that 2% of certificates issued for this project are allocated to InPlanet's buffer pool.\\n\\nTo date, this project has contributed 7.789 certificates to the buffer pool which holds a total of 14.189 certificates.\\n\\nInPlanet has no reversals to date.\\n\\nLearn more about reversal risk\"}"